      space(),

      h2("Class Abstrak"),
      para(
        "Class abstrak adalah kelas yang tidak dapat diinstansiasi secara langsung dan berfungsi " +
        "sebagai template bagi kelas turunannya. Berbeda dengan interface, class abstrak dapat " +
        "memiliki method yang sudah diimplementasikan (method konkret) maupun method abstrak yang " +
        "wajib diimplementasikan oleh class turunan. Class abstrak menggunakan kata kunci abstract " +
        "dan diturunkan menggunakan extends. Sebuah kelas hanya bisa mewarisi satu class abstrak."
      ),
      space(),

      h2("Tabel Perbandingan"),
      new Table({
        width: { size: 9026, type: WidthType.DXA },
        columnWidths: [2500, 3263, 3263],
        rows: [
          new TableRow({ children: [cell("Aspek", true, 2500), cell("Interface", true, 3263), cell("Class Abstrak", true, 3263)] }),
          new TableRow({ children: [cellL("Kata kunci", false, 2500), cellL("interface / implements", false, 3263), cellL("abstract class / extends", false, 3263)] }),
          new TableRow({ children: [cellL("Implementasi method", false, 2500), cellL("Tidak boleh ada", false, 3263), cellL("Boleh ada (konkret & abstrak)", false, 3263)] }),
          new TableRow({ children: [cellL("Property", false, 2500), cellL("Hanya konstanta", false, 3263), cellL("Boleh property biasa", false, 3263)] }),
          new TableRow({ children: [cellL("Multiple", false, 2500), cellL("Bisa implements banyak", false, 3263), cellL("Hanya extends satu", false, 3263)] }),
          new TableRow({ children: [cellL("Constructor", false, 2500), cellL("Tidak bisa", false, 3263), cellL("Bisa", false, 3263)] }),
          new TableRow({ children: [cellL("Tujuan utama", false, 2500), cellL("Kontrak perilaku", false, 3263), cellL("Template dengan logika bersama", false, 3263)] }),
        ]
      }),

      space(), divider(),

      // ══ SOAL 2 ════════════════════════════════════════════════════
      h1("2. Implementasi Interface LoginSystem dan RegisterSystem pada Kelas User"),
      space(),

      para(
        "Berikut adalah contoh implementasi dua interface sekaligus pada satu kelas di PHP. " +
        "Kelas User mengimplementasikan interface LoginSystem dan RegisterSystem secara bersamaan, " +
        "yang menunjukkan kemampuan multiple interface implementation dalam PHP."
      ),
      space(),
      h2("Kode Program"),

      ...codeBlock([
        "<?php",
        "",
        "// ── Interface LoginSystem ──────────────────────────────────",
        "interface LoginSystem {",
        "    public function login(string $email, string $password): bool;",
        "    public function logout(): void;",
        "}",
        "",
        "// ── Interface RegisterSystem ───────────────────────────────",
        "interface RegisterSystem {",
        "    public function register(string $nama, string $email, string $password): bool;",
        "    public function validasiEmail(string $email): bool;",
        "}",
        "",
        "// ── Class User mengimplementasikan dua interface sekaligus ──",
        "class User implements LoginSystem, RegisterSystem {",
        "    private string $nama;",
        "    private string $email;",
        "    private string $password;",
        "    private bool   $isLoggedIn = false;",
        "",
        "    // Implementasi method dari LoginSystem",
        "    public function login(string $email, string $password): bool {",
        "        if ($this->email === $email && $this->password === $password) {",
        "            $this->isLoggedIn = true;",
        "            echo $this->nama . ' berhasil login.<br>';",
        "            return true;",
        "        }",
        "        echo 'Login gagal. Email atau password salah.<br>';",
        "        return false;",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    public function logout(): void {",
        "        $this->isLoggedIn = false;",
        "        echo $this->nama . ' telah logout.<br>';",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    // Implementasi method dari RegisterSystem",
        "    public function register(string $nama, string $email, string $password): bool {",
        "        if (!$this->validasiEmail($email)) {",
        "            echo 'Registrasi gagal. Format email tidak valid.<br>';",
        "            return false;",
        "        }",
        "        $this->nama     = $nama;",
        "        $this->email    = $email;",
        "        $this->password = $password;",
        "        echo $nama . ' berhasil registrasi.<br>';",
        "        return true;",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    public function validasiEmail(string $email): bool {",
        "        return filter_var($email, FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL) !== false;",
        "    }",
        "}",
        "",
        "// ── Penggunaan ─────────────────────────────────────────────",
        "$user = new User();",
        "$user->register('Budi', 'budi@email.com', 'pass123');",
        "$user->login('budi@email.com', 'pass123');",
        "$user->logout();",
        "$user->login('budi@email.com', 'salah');",
